      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omobani ogotogonyera Yehosafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, akairana nka bwoye agwo Yerusalemu, orendire buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu omoorori, mosinto o Hanani, akagenda korotota Yehosafati omorwoti, akamobooria, “Inee! Nabo ekogwenerete gokonya abanto ababe, naende gwancha baria bagechete Omonene? Ase engencho eyio endamwamu y’Omonene yagocheire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, obuya bonde mbore ime asore, aye gwasaretie emete y’Asera, enyasae eria enkungu, ekarua ense eye, naende kwerure korigia Nyasae nenkoro yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati okoirania Abayuda ase Omonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati akaba okomenya agwo Yerusalemu; akagenda ase abanto bamenyete gochakera Beeri‐Seba goikeera ense y’ebitunwa y’Efraimu, akabairania ase Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachora abagaambi ebiina ase ense eria yonsi, akababeeka ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda yagiteire chindwaki, omochie ase omochie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabateebia, “Rengereria egento mogokora, ekiagera timori gokorera Mwanyabaanto ase okogamba, korende n’Omonene mogokorera; ere nigo are amo nainwe ase okogamba na konacha ebiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono moiroke Omonene. Mwerende na momanye eki mogokora, ekiagera Omonene, Nyasae oito, tari koonchorana oboronge, gose tari gwanchereria abanto, gose tari koegwa riaaki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo agwo Yerusalemu, Yehosafati akabeeka Abalawi bande, na abakuani, na abateneneri be chiamate chi’Abaisraeli, bakaba bakogamba ebiina ribaga ri’Omonene, naende bagatorania amariomana. Ekero abagaambi baria barenge koba bairanire agwo Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabachika, akabora, “Nigo morakore emeremo ase okomoiroka Omonene na ase obwegenwa, na ase chinkoro chiaino chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero kende gionsi ebiina bikorentwa ase more korwa ase abanto bamino, baria bamenyete ase emechie yabo, onye niigoro y’ogoiterwa kw’amanyinga, gose niigoro y’amang’ana ande onsi ay’amachiiko na emeroberio yonsi echiikire, rirorio mobakuurere ng’a tibaabaisa gokora okomocha ase Omonene, erinde endamwamu yaye tebaisa gocha igoro ase more na ase abanto baria bamino. Moise gokora bo, rirorio timokoba abamochi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigereria, Amaria, Omokuani bw’omonene, nabatenenere igoro ase amang’ana onsi ay’Omonene; na Sebadia, mosinto o Isumaeli, omogabana bw’Abayuda, ere nabatenenere ase amang’ana onsi ay’omorwoti, na Abalawi mbaabakorere buna abakoonyi baino. Mobe abaremu ase ande onsi mogokora, n’Omonene abe amo nabagokora ayare amaronge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
